<title>MEXICO: Carso offers to buy Porcelanite shares.</title>
<headline>Carso offers to buy Porcelanite shares.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Holding company Grupo Carso offered to buy 495,407 ordinary shares from holders of stock in its building materials subsidiary Porcelanite on Monday.</p>
<p>In a paid newspaper advertisement, Carso said it would offer a price of 3.75 pesos per share, thus making the offer worth a total of 1,857,776.25 pesos. Porcelanite has 171 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Carso said that once the offer was concluded, it would request that Porcelanite stocks be delisted from the Mexican Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Daniel Perez, Monterrey bureau +528 345-7617</p>
